WEBVTT

1
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:47.100
Check first, then spi up builds your environment

2
00:00:47.100 --> 00:01:17.128
spi up returns before the environment is usable; wait for Deployable

3
00:01:17.128 --> 00:01:38.884
spi info names your endpoints, and spi down gives the environment back

4
00:01:38.884 --> 00:02:04.472
Easy mistake: The command finished, so it is ready.

